        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86374, Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Bin Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek's Carbon Fiber Silver Bin Pull is a modern addition to any kitchen remodel. It is available in satin nickel or polished chrome with a silver carbon fiber insert. This Silver Carbon Fiber Bin Pull is available in 2 sizes: 3 inches and 4 inches. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/silver-carbon-fiber-cabinet-knob-emtek-86370\"> <b>Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/carbon-fiber-silver-bar-cabinet-pull-emtek-86385\"><b>Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Carbon Fiber Bin Pull in Silver:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Carbon Fiber and Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86374-specifications.pdf?v=1704262411\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Carbon Fiber Silver Bin Pull Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86374:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86375:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
